  m_text: 'After narrowly escaping a crash landing, the player finds themselves stranded
    on a mysterious planet composed of floating elemental islands. Each island is
    governed by one of the four elements: Fire, Water, Earth, and Air. The player
    must traverse these islands to find scattered pieces of a broken antenna, which
    is their only hope for rescue. Along the way, they will uncover ancient ruins,
    battle elemental guardians, and harness the power of the elements to solve puzzles
    and survive the hostile environments.

'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2318347f0f105904b92124044d61625d, type: 2}
